## Hints

- E2: `r.shift(1) < 0` is yesterday's condition; dropna the shifted masks;
  each conditional's n differs — report it.
- E3: A ⊂ B, so A∩B = A: P(A|B) = P(A)/P(B) < 1, P(B|A) = 1.
